# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SOURCE DOCUMENTS ARE NEVER COMMITTED.
#
# The Red Herring Prospectus embeds photographs of a real PAN card and a real
# Aadhaar card — names, parents' names, dates of birth, national identifiers,
# faces and a signature.  Publishing the input to a public repository would
# disclose all of it, which is the exact harm this tool exists to prevent.
#
# The *redacted* output is committed, because it has been verified to leak
# nothing: see evaluation/EVALUATION_REPORT.md §3 and §3.1.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
!pii-redaction/output/*-REDACTED.docx
!pii-redaction/output/* - REDACTED.docx
!pii-redaction/examples/*.docx

# The assignment brief is the task-setter's document, not part of the solution.
Enterprise Data - Assignment.pdf

# OS and editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
~$*

# Local environment
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# git-lfs writes hooks to a literal dev/null path on Windows
dev/
